<div id="albums" data-albums="{select:albums htmlAttrJson, fields='title, released', rows=3/}"></div>

<p>The attribute as the page holds it:</p>
<pre><code>{select:albums htmlAttrJson, fields='title, released', rows=3/}</code></pre>

<p>One row - htmlAttrJson='record':</p>
<pre><code>{select:albums htmlAttrJson='record', fields='title, price', $album_id=7/}</code></pre>
